id: pm-gantt-chart-ci-v2
title: Apply Fleet CI v2 quick PR and deep tiers
description: Companion pm-cli-website-dyhg. Preserve all release checks while reducing hosted PR repetition and seeded depth.
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[2]: ci,performance
created_at: "2026-11-15T15:35:39.365Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-15T15:39:33.050Z"
author: codex-sol
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-15T15:35:43.011Z",codex-sol,"Plan: preserve required test (22.18.0) and test (26); audit docs and identity inputs; retain committed dist verification. Latest successful main run 43706369121 returns no combined log, so inspect job logs and seeded source. Deep tier keeps both full npm and Bun gates per Node version. Release rollout files remain owned by pm-ops#272."
  "2026-11-15T15:37:58.467Z",codex-sol,"Baseline job logs recovered through the jobs API: Node 22.18.0 executes in 4m30s; Node 26 in 8m03s, but creation-to-completion is 62m14s and 128m04s. Longest seeded suite: 68.55s; calibration 18.50s; drift 15.82s. Typecheck, test typecheck and lint passed through pm test. Strict workflow YAML parsing passed (actionlint unavailable). Quick touched suites and one quick coverage run are in progress. Local npm install required clearing an inherited user npm allow-scripts configuration; no repository configuration changed."
  "2026-11-15T15:38:52.069Z",codex-sol,"Docs gate input audit: README is read by smoke.test.ts; package dry-run includes README and CHANGELOG; identity-audit examines git identities and added lines, including tracker prose. All stay in the docs path. Seeded suites use deterministic prefixes; calibration minimum samples is derived from generated valid episodes, with explicit nonempty success and exclusion categories. Frozen compatibility digest now checks a separately recorded 30-case prefix in quick mode. No product time budget is scaled."
  "2026-11-15T15:39:33.049Z",codex-sol,"Quick-prefix validation found zero blocked-start attempts in the first 50 drift cases. Added deterministic blocked-start refusals to drift and waiting without changing the seeded generator, and derive seeded refusal totals from the independent model. Historical strict-health provenance warning remains advisory and exits zero. Quick coverage and touched suites are still running; no full local test depth was invoked."
